      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COLLINDA POPS (2) comes off an average performance last start when seventh at Geelong over 400m behind Doongalla Rocket (23.25) in a Grade 5. Has ability and looks hard to stop. CHALKY (3) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish second (22.79) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 390m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from six attempts. Will give a great sight again. PAW KIPLIN (7) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (23.18) at Warragul last time. Has ability and can atone. PAW VANCOUVER (8) was in the money again last time and not beaten far when third (22.67) at Ballarat in a Free For All.",
